v 3
d 'SPINEDX': Classify spine diagnoses from ICD-9-CM and ICD-10-CM codes
d
d Classifies ICD-9-CM and ICD-10-CM diagnosis codes into 16 spine diagnosis
d categories, a degenerative diagnosis hierarchy and vertebral regions,
d using one code library so that trends can span the October 2015
d transition from ICD-9 to ICD-10.
d
d Requires Stata 16 or later.
d
d Author: Brook I. Martin, PhD, MPH
d Department of Orthopaedics, University of Utah
d Support: Brook.Martin@hsc.utah.edu
d
d Version 2.6.1
d Distribution-Date: 20261105
d
f spinedx.ado
f spinedx.sthlp
F spinedx_codes.csv
f spinedx_test.do
